# Tuaf is a commercial font. Its licence covers embedding it in the built app, NOT
# redistributing the file — so it must never be committed to a public repo.
# Drop your licensed copy in Aura/Aura/ and the build phase picks it up.
*.otf
*.ttf

# Vavin is our own font, SIL OFL 1.1 — redistribution is explicitly permitted, so it
# ships in the repo unlike the commercially licensed faces the rules above cover.
!Aura/Aura/Vavin*.ttf
!Aura/Aura/Vavin-OFL.txt
